{"accountName": "腾讯代码安全检查Xcheck", "author": "腾讯代码安全检查Xcheck", "body": null, "content": [{"text": "原创 腾讯云代码分析 2024-12-31 17:30 广东", "type": "p"}, {"text": "TCA融合工具Xcheck，致力于挖掘代码中隐藏的安全风险，提升代码安全质量。", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": 1, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/8SDYbMEObOIuh5LjEbGE4HaibJfS2LWDEL3b1ibh6vPaXpog2SLTYlianNZ2v0pyLHduBygicYiaOlZYHI2YGIWyrew/0?wx_fmt=jpeg", "type": "img"}, {"_imgCount": 2, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Wl5fxRNUSKiaoCK7j6treg7xfJhppNTSZOoSzpDTEibraPImqqNA7vWiaMfZ0ESQia2LkdicckqgDol89xOYWCVsUaw/640?wx_fmt=other&from=appmsg&wxfrom=10005&wx_lazy=1&wx_co=1&tp=webp", "type": "img"}, {"text": "国内镜像： https://git.code.tencent.com/Tencent_Open_Source/CodeAnalysis", "type": "p"}, {"text": "TCA介绍", "type": "h"}, {"text": "腾讯云代码分析于 2013 年从个别独立代码分析工具开始，持续逐步迭代强化，至今发展成集众多分析工具的云原生、分布式、高性能的代码综合分析跟踪子系统，支持三十余种编程语言的分析。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "TCA优势", "type": "h"}, {"text": "目前，腾讯云代码分析覆盖了业内主流的 33门语言 ，并支持自动识别语言，同时也支持扫描多种框架。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "使用说明", "type": "h"}, {"text": "在方案页面，TCA官方体验分析方案内可以看到Xcheck安全规则包已启用。进入官方方案->选择分析的代码库->启动分析。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "提示：Xcheck安全规则 包目前只支持在官方体验分析方案中试用。", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": 3, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Wl5fxRNUSKg3eWfy0Tma2BJwVzUSFBRicsOgWV2gfYm9Hult06xC8s3TuwKfQMDkMh7YPIwxBJZviaxMgaqVibnZg/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg", "type": "img"}, {"_imgCount": 4, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Wl5fxRNUSKg3eWfy0Tma2BJwVzUSFBRicmGMzQsvjqA9ycMgtp9hLhrFNia40fI85tticHoB8JCGTqFicXicWJX79Hg/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg", "type": "img"}, {"_imgCount": 5, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Wl5fxRNUSKg3eWfy0Tma2BJwVzUSFBRicdHAhV3JOBRKhxxvWibwJA9jicJ2YtMfX4G6h7HicSl9xr18UvicW9gribqQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "跳转微信打开", "type": "p"}], "cover": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/8SDYbMEObOIuh5LjEbGE4HaibJfS2LWDEL3b1ibh6vPaXpog2SLTYlianNZ2v0pyLHduBygicYiaOlZYHI2YGIWyrew/0?wx_fmt=jpeg", "date": "12月31日", "id": "2760761792", "summary": "原创 腾讯云代码分析 2024-12-31 17:30 广东 \nTCA融合工具Xcheck，致力于挖掘代码中隐藏的安全风险，提升代码安全质量。\n官网地址： （点击最下方【阅读原文】可直达） https://tca.tencent.com/ 官网介绍： https://cloud.tencent.com/product/tcap 官方开源： https://github.com/Tencent/Co", "title": "【腾讯云代码分析】TCA融合工具Xcheck（试用版）", "ts": 1735637400000, "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg2ODQ3ODE1NA==&mid=2247486404&idx=1&sn=c5dbb0295f59014dd2229566a8670655"}